  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.28,
      409.68,
      297.62,
      452.63
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, No. 28 of 1964 (Amendment)that the Government intends to acquire the following landwhich is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      80.4,
      464.64,
      238.4,
      474.71
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.28,
      486.72,
      297.91,
      584.63
    ],
    "text": "Four (04) allotments of land in total extent 0.0847 Hectaredepicted as lot no. 232, 233, 236 & 237 in the Sheet No. 09of Block No. 01 in Cadastral Map No. 810019 prepared bythe Surveyor General situated in the Village of Maligaspein the Grama Niladhari Division No. 101E of Maligaspe,within Municipal Council limit of Galle DivisionalSecretary's Division of Four Gravets, Galle District of Galle,Southern Province. The names, extent and boundaries ofthe said allotments of land are as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.28,
      594.72,
      297.45,
      637.19
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 232Name of the Land: Not Stated; Description: Scrub jungle;Claimant: State; Original Claimant: National HousingDevelopment Authority; Extent: about 0.0269 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.28,
      648.72,
      297.45,
      691.91
    ],
    "text": "02. Lot No. 233Name of the Land: Not Stated; Description: Scrub jungle;Claimant: State; Original Claimant: National HousingDevelopment Authority; Extent: about 0.0258 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      322.56,
      562.15,
      368.63
    ],
    "text": "03. Lot No. 236Name of the Land: Not Stated; Description: Road; Claimant:State; Original Claimant:Could not be traced; Extent: about0.0008 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      380.16,
      562.01,
      426.23
    ],
    "text": "04. Lot No. 237Name of the Land: Not Stated; Description: Scrub jungle;Claimant: State; Original Claimant: National HousingDevelopment Authority; Extent: about 0.0312 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      437.76,
      562.17,
      543.83
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are herebyrequired to appear personally, or by agents duly authorizedin writing, before me at the Four Gravets Galle, DivisionalSecretariat on 08.10.2018 at 09.00 a.m. and are herebyrequested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or beforethe 03.10.2018, the nature of their interests in the lands, theparticulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisitionof the said Lands, the amount of compensation and the detailsof the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      557.76,
      561.74,
      579.83
    ],
    "text": "All deeds and documents in support of the claims shouldbe produced before me at the inquiry.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
